===Noun===
{{en-noun|sg=[[sebaceous]] [[gland]]}}

# {{anatomy}} A gland of the skin which secretes an oily substance, [[sebum]], usually into a [[hair follicle]] near the surface of the skin.

====Synonyms====
* [[sebaceous follicle]]
* [[glandulae sebaceae]]

